		{"id":"2b53481dfe4ecad4","type":"file","file":"99. attachments/BLUE_PRINCE_s8WCczCdZC.png","x":-1480,"y":-345,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"ac9b1ef002ca3a06",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"After solving the puzzle, you can obtain a permanent power among these pieces. Apparently you can change the chosen piece by doing something (probably doing the puzzle again.)",
